# drift_run — ELEC2, a frozen model vs the world
# python 3.11.5 · numpy 1.24.4 · pandas 2.2.3 · scipy 1.11.1 · scikit-learn 1.8.0 · arm64
# data: electricity.arff md5 8ca97867d960ae029ae3a9ac2c923d34 (matches OpenML) · rows 45,312 · weeks 135
# vicprice/vicdemand/transfer are one constant fill until row 17,424 (week 51.9) — Victoria's data only starts then
# date column decreases at rows [25487, 34895, 35231, 36239, 40703] — not used
# frozen model: features ['day', 'period', 'nswprice', 'nswdemand'], trained on weeks 0–51 (17,472 rows), training accuracy 0.874

